{
  "_comentario": [
    "PROPOSTA de regras do Realtime Database.",
    "",
    "Este arquivo NAO esta ligado ao firebase.json e NAO foi publicado.",
    "Revise, teste no simulador do console e so entao aplique.",
    "",
    "Hoje o banco esta aberto: qualquer pessoa sem login le users,",
    "companys (com CPF/CNPJ) e invites via curl.",
    "",
    "Pontos de atencao ao aplicar:",
    "- companiesIndex precisa de leitura publica (a tela Explorar",
    "  roda sem login).",
    "- documentsIndex nunca libera o no pai, so a chave exata.",
    "- users fica restrito ao proprio uid; a checagem de e-mail",
    "  existente (Invite e cadastro) precisa virar Cloud Function",
    "  antes de aplicar a regra abaixo, senao essas telas quebram.",
    "- a consulta rasa de companys no contexto passa a falhar e cai",
    "  automaticamente para companiesIndex, que e publico.",
    "",
    "Markfy Studio (studioDrafts, studioSites, studioLeads, studioAnalytics):",
    "- o rascunho e isolado por empresa; publicar exige papel diferente de 'professional';",
    "- users/{uid}/bookedCompanies ja e coberto pela regra de users/$uid;",
    "- imagens do Studio vao para o Storage em companys/{handle}/studio/ (revise as regras do Storage).",
    "",
    "Markfy Menus (menusCatalog, menusSettings, menusDrafts, menusSites, menusSlugs, menusFloor,",
    "menusOps, menusTrack, menusLedger, menusAudit, menusStock, menusStockMoves, menusStaff, menusRate):",
    "- operacao (mesas, comandas, pedidos, pagamentos, estoque, planta, publicacao) so pelo backend (menusApi);",
    "- o navegador grava apenas catalogo, configuracoes, rascunho de aparencia e perfis da equipe, conforme o papel;",
    "- licenca com product 'all' (Premium) libera Bookings, Studio e Menus; as regras do Studio ja aceitam 'all';",
    "- imagens do Menus vao para o Storage em companys/{handle}/menus/."
  ],
  "rules": {
    ".read": false,
    ".write": false,
    "companiesIndex": {
      ".read": true,
      "$handle": {
        ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()"
      }
    },
    "documentsIndex": {
      ".read": false,
      ".write": false,
      "$document": {
        ".read": "auth != null",
        ".write": "auth != null"
      }
    },
    "licenses": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Plano de cada EMPRESA (nao da pessoa): licenses/{handle}.",
        "Gravam so a conta master (tela Master Dev) e o backend",
        "(Cloud Function que confirma o pagamento, via Admin SDK).",
        "Nenhum membro da empresa, nem o administrador principal,",
        "consegue escrever aqui pelo navegador. Membros so leem."
      ],
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()"
      }
    },
    "companys": {
      "_comentario_master": "A leitura do no inteiro e exclusiva da conta master (painel Master Dev).",
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      ".write": false,
      "$handle": {
        ".read": true,
        ".write": "auth != null && (!data.exists() || data.child('members').child(auth.uid).exists())",
        "joinRequests": {
          "_comentario": [
            "Pedido de entrada numa empresa.",
            "",
            "Quem pede AINDA NAO e membro, entao a regra do $handle",
            "acima (que exige membro para escrever) o barraria. Esta",
            "regra mais funda devolve o acesso, mas so ao proprio no:",
            "cada pessoa escreve companys/{handle}/joinRequests/{seu uid}.",
            "",
            "O .validate impede o solicitante de se auto-aprovar: ele",
            "so consegue gravar status 'pending'. Mudar para 'approved'",
            "exige ser membro."
          ],
          "$uid": {
            ".read": "auth != null && (auth.uid === $uid || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists())",
            ".write": "auth != null && (auth.uid === $uid || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists())",
            ".validate": "!data.exists() || !newData.exists() || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists() || newData.child('status').val() === 'pending'"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "users": {
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      ".write": false,
      ".indexOn": [
        "email"
      ],
      "$uid": {
        ".read": "auth != null && auth.uid === $uid",
        ".write": "auth != null && auth.uid === $uid",
        "companyHandle": {
          "_comentario": [
            "Ao aprovar um pedido, quem administra grava o handle no",
            "usuario aprovado — e esse no pertence a OUTRA pessoa, que",
            "a regra de users/$uid so libera para o dono.",
            "",
            "Esta regra abre exatamente esse caso: um membro da empresa",
            "pode escrever o companyHandle de alguem que tem um pedido",
            "aprovado naquela empresa. Nada alem disso.",
            "",
            "A tela de espera tambem grava esse campo sozinha ao ver a",
            "aprovacao, entao o fluxo funciona mesmo que esta regra",
            "seja removida."
          ],
          ".write": "auth != null && (auth.uid === $uid || root.child('companys').child(newData.val()).child('joinRequests').child($uid).child('status').val() === 'approved')"
        }
      }
    },
    "invites": {
      ".read": false,
      ".write": false,
      "$inviteId": {
        ".read": true,
        ".write": "auth != null"
      }
    },
    "mercadoPagoConnections": {
      ".read": false,
      ".write": false,
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()"
      }
    },
    "studioDrafts": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Rascunho do Markfy Studio. So membros da empresa leem;",
        "so responsavel/administrador grava (profissional so visualiza)."
      ],
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists() && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() !== 'professional' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(studio|both|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)"
      }
    },
    "studioSites": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Pagina publicada pelo Studio: leitura publica (rota /s/{handle}) SOMENTE enquanto",
        "a empresa tem plano ativo com Studio; escrita so por responsavel/administrador",
        "da propria empresa, tambem exigindo plano ativo com Studio."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(studio|both|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)",
        ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists() && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() !== 'professional' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(studio|both|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)"
      },
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')"
    },
    "studioLeads": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Contatos do formulario da pagina publica.",
        "Visitante sem login so CRIA um contato novo com status 'new';",
        "ler, mudar estado e excluir exige ser membro (estado/exclusao: editor)."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        "$leadId": {
          ".write": "(!data.exists() && newData.exists() && newData.child('status').val() === 'new') || (auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists() && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() !== 'professional')",
          ".validate": "!newData.exists() || newData.hasChildren(['name', 'status', 'createdAt'])",
          "name": {
            ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length > 0 && newData.val().length <= 120"
          },
          "phone": {
            ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 40"
          },
          "email": {
            ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 160"
          },
          "message": {
            ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 2000"
          },
          "status": {
            ".validate": "newData.val() === 'new' || newData.val() === 'contacted' || newData.val() === 'done' || newData.val() === 'archived'"
          },
          "source": {
            ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 20"
          },
          "createdAt": {
            ".validate": "newData.isNumber()"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            ".validate": "newData.isNumber()"
          },
          "$other": {
            ".validate": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "studioAnalytics": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Contadores diarios da pagina publicada.",
        "Qualquer visitante so consegue SOMAR 1 a um evento conhecido do dia;",
        "nao da para apagar, zerar nem inventar evento. Leitura: membros."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        "$day": {
          ".validate": "$day.matches(/^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$/)",
          "$event": {
            ".write": "newData.exists()",
            ".validate": "($event === 'view' || $event === 'booking_click' || $event === 'whatsapp_click' || $event === 'social_click' || $event === 'channel_click' || $event === 'lead') && newData.isNumber() && ((!data.exists() && newData.val() === 1) || newData.val() === data.val() + 1)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "planCatalog": {
      "_comentario": "Catalogo de planos: leitura publica (tela de planos), escrita so da conta master.",
      ".read": true,
      ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')"
    },
    "planOrders": {
      "_comentario": "Pedidos de plano. Escrita so pelo backend (Admin SDK); a conta master le.",
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      ".write": false
    },
    "publicAccess": {
      "_comentario": "Espelho publico minimo da licenca (bookings/studio/menus/expiresAt). Leitura publica; escrita so da conta master e do backend.",
      ".read": true,
      ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')"
    },
    "masterProfiles": {
      "_comentario": "Registro da troca da senha provisoria das contas master. Cada conta le e grava so o proprio no.",
      "$uid": {
        ".read": "auth != null && auth.uid === $uid",
        ".write": "auth != null && auth.uid === $uid && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')"
      }
    },
    "menusCatalog": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Cardapios, categorias, produtos e adicionais do Markfy Menus.",
        "Leitura publica enquanto a licenca inclui o Menus (o cardapio publico le daqui);",
        "membros sempre leem. Escrita: dono, administrador ou gerente (menusStaff).",
        "A cozinha pode marcar produto como disponivel/indisponivel.",
        "Preco e validado como inteiro em centavos."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "(root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(menus|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)) || auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'master' || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'administrator' || (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'professional' && root.child('menusStaff').child($handle).child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'manager'))",
        "products": {
          "$productId": {
            "priceCents": {
              ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0 && newData.val() <= 100000000 && newData.val() % 1 === 0"
            },
            "promoPriceCents": {
              ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0 && newData.val() % 1 === 0"
            },
            "available": {
              ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'professional' && root.child('menusStaff').child($handle).child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'kitchen'",
              ".validate": "newData.isBoolean()"
            }
          }
        },
        "menus": {
          ".indexOn": [
            "order"
          ]
        },
        "categories": {
          ".indexOn": [
            "menuId",
            "order"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "menusSettings": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Dados publicos da operacao: perfil, contato, horarios, entrega, formas de pagamento e endereco publico.",
        "Nada sigiloso deve morar aqui. Escrita: dono ou administrador."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "(root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(menus|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)) || auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'master' || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'administrator')"
      }
    },
    "menusDrafts": {
      "_comentario": "Rascunho da aparencia do cardapio. Membros leem; dono, administrador e gerente gravam. Publicar e no backend.",
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'master' || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'administrator' || (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'professional' && root.child('menusStaff').child($handle).child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'manager'))"
      }
    },
    "menusSites": {
      "_comentario": "Aparencia PUBLICADA. So o backend (menusApi/design.publish) grava, depois de aplicar o plano.",
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "(root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(menus|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)) || auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": false
      }
    },
    "menusSlugs": {
      "_comentario": "Endereco publico /m/{slug} -> handle. Leitura publica de uma chave por vez; so o backend grava.",
      "$slug": {
        ".read": true,
        ".write": false
      }
    },
    "menusFloor": {
      "_comentario": "Planta: ambientes e mesas. Leitura publica (o QR da mesa mostra o nome dela). So o backend grava (limite de mesas do plano).",
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "(root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(menus|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)) || auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": false
      }
    },
    "menusOps": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Operacao: estado das mesas, comandas, pedidos, chamados, sequencias e chaves de idempotencia.",
        "Membros leem (tempo real entre aparelhos). NINGUEM grava pelo navegador:",
        "toda mudanca passa pela Cloud Function menusApi, com transacao e auditoria."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": false,
        "orders": {
          ".indexOn": [
            "createdAt",
            "status",
            "dayKey"
          ]
        },
        "tabs": {
          ".indexOn": [
            "status",
            "openedAt",
            "closedAt"
          ]
        },
        "calls": {
          ".indexOn": [
            "status"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "menusTrack": {
      "_comentario": "Acompanhamento publico do pedido, sem dados pessoais. Le-se so pelo id (impossivel listar). Grava o backend.",
      "$handle": {
        "$orderId": {
          ".read": true,
          ".write": false
        }
      }
    },
    "menusLedger": {
      "_comentario": "Livro de recebimentos e estornos (caixa). Leitura: dono, administrador, gerente e caixa. Grava o backend.",
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "(auth != null && (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'master' || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'administrator' || (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'professional' && root.child('menusStaff').child($handle).child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'manager'))) || (auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'professional' && root.child('menusStaff').child($handle).child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'cashier')",
        ".write": false,
        ".indexOn": [
          "at",
          "dayKey"
        ]
      }
    },
    "menusAudit": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Registro de auditoria. O backend grava descontos, cancelamentos, estornos, reaberturas e transferencias.",
        "O painel so ACRESCENTA registros de alteracao de preco e de permissao (nunca altera nem apaga)."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'master' || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'administrator' || (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'professional' && root.child('menusStaff').child($handle).child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'manager'))",
        ".indexOn": [
          "at"
        ],
        "$entryId": {
          ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'master' || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'administrator' || (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'professional' && root.child('menusStaff').child($handle).child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'manager')) && !data.exists() && newData.exists()",
          ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['type', 'at', 'by']) && newData.child('by').val() === auth.uid && newData.child('type').isString() && newData.child('type').val().matches(/^(catalog|team)[.]/)"
        }
      }
    },
    "menusStock": {
      "_comentario": "Estoque por produto. Membros leem; so o backend movimenta (baixa por pedido, entrada, perda, contagem).",
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": false
      }
    },
    "menusStockMoves": {
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": false,
        ".indexOn": [
          "at",
          "productId"
        ]
      }
    },
    "menusStaff": {
      "_comentario": "Perfil de cada profissional no Menus (gerente, garcom, caixa, cozinha, entregador) e ajustes de permissao. Grava: dono ou administrador.",
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        "$uid": {
          ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'master' || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'administrator')",
          ".validate": "!newData.exists() || (newData.child('role').isString() && newData.child('role').val().matches(/^(manager|waiter|cashier|kitchen|delivery)$/))"
        }
      }
    },
    "menusRate": {
      "_comentario": "Contadores do freio de pedidos publicos (backend).",
      ".read": false,
      ".write": false
    }
  }
}
